flowchart LR
    Source[Versioned source events] --> Availability[Availability-time gate]
    Availability --> State[Past-only feature state]
    State --> Bundle[Serialized preprocessing and model]
    Bundle --> Score[Score and reason codes]
    Score --> Policy[Versioned action policy]
    Policy --> Decision[Decision artifact]
    Source --> Provenance[Source event IDs]
    State --> Provenance
    Bundle --> Provenance
    Policy --> Provenance
    Decision --> Provenance
    Provenance --> Store[(Immutable run store)]

